{"content":[{"c":["HABAZZINIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Jaazaniah’s grandfather. Jaazaniah was a leader of the Recabites, warriors tested by Jeremiah with regard to their forefather’s command not to drink wine (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.35.3","r":"Jer.35.3","rawR":"Jer.35.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.35.3","value":"Jer.35.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 35:3"},"). They remained loyal to the command, and Jeremiah used their loyalty in an appeal to Judah to be faithful to God."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Habazziniah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jer 35:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.35.3","rawQueryValue":"Jer.35.3","sourceRefExact":"Jer.35.3"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"63c00bd67e911e71ec149f3d638d305dc68f77cdb37c451bcafaccf933ecc2f1","sourceItemName":"Habazziniah","sourceItemOrder":5,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Habazziniah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Habazziniah","title":"Habazziniah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}